WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.090 --> 00:00:11.430
That's because even though people like you
who are young

00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:14.591
and healthy will probably not get sick from
this,

00:00:14.591 --> 00:00:18.020
this is really not something that's scary
for you,

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:21.680
there are people who could potentially become
sick,

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:22.680
right?

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:26.060
And, so we're talking about people who are
older,

00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:31.289
or people who are already sick with other
types of things, like someone who might have

00:00:31.289 --> 00:00:35.140
cancer
and is on special kinds of medicines, their

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:39.390
immune systems are kind of like not really
working great.

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:46.390
And, so the reason why we're not going to
places where there are lots of people that

00:00:46.390 --> 00:00:49.809
could
gather on an inside, is to make sure we're

00:00:49.809 --> 00:00:53.010
not spreading the disease to people-- the
virus-- to

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:56.280
people who could get really sick from it.

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:59.489
So, people who don't have very good immune
systems right now.

00:00:59.489 --> 00:01:05.330
And, so we're actually doing this
so that we can protect the people around us,

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:09.580
and I think that's a really important thing
for humans to do, is to protect each other,

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:10.580
right?

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:12.310
And, that's one of the ways that we're doing
it.

00:01:12.310 --> 00:01:17.080
And, it also helps our hospitals by making
sure that people are

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:21.110
reducing the amount of exposure to other people.

00:01:21.110 --> 00:01:26.390
It'll help our hospitals be able to handle
taking care of the people who are actually

00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:27.390
sick from this.

00:01:27.390 --> 00:01:33.100
And, so we're helping doctors
and we’re helping nurses and we're helping

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:39.690
healthcare professionals by making sure
that they are not going to be like bombarded

00:01:39.690 --> 00:01:40.690
with patients.

00:01:40.690 --> 00:01:43.100
So, it's really important that we do this.

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:44.250
And it's hard.

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:49.041
It's hard not to be with our friends,
but it's one of the biggest helpers that we

00:01:49.041 --> 00:01:52.049
can do in our community.

